# A buttress screw thread typed in, its load flank turned back by the
# choice beside the hand, on an extruded circle; the same model as
# path_thread_buttress.go makes (TestPathEquivalence/thread_buttress).
key c
move 300 300
down L 300 300
up L 300 300
move 350 300
down L 350 300
up L 350 300
key esc
key x shift
move 350 300
down L 350 300
up L 350 300
menu Features|Screw Thread...
# [change] the designation to a DIN 513 buttress thread.
twmove 172 110
twdown L 172 110
twup L 172 110
edit S20x4
# The load flank turned back, at the end of the pitch's row.
twmove 525 130
twdown L 525 130
twup L 525 130
# Flip the direction: against the circle's normal, down into the part;
# then made.
twmove 60 230
twdown L 60 230
twup L 60 230
twmove 37 260
twdown L 37 260
twup L 37 260
